Then tests can call advance(1.5) after each action, making sequences progress in game time quickly. This is much faster and deterministic.

Let me add that and rewrite test to use advance. Note: `update` uses `this.time += dt` and tasks. Rendering only at end. Audio might stack but okay.

One caveat: update() calls `document.exitPointerLock` etc. fine.

