Maybe it's Mace's head: Mace is at (2.1,0,-12.9). If Mace's `group` is at that position but his body is missing? The right figure is Mace (with shotgun). Hmm.

Wait, the floating head is at x≈690/800 in the crop, which corresponds to original x≈400+345=745, y≈180/500*? Actually crop scale 2x: original x = 400 + 690/2 = 745, y = 10 + 180/2 = 100. So screen (745,100). The chase camera is at (-3.8,1.72,-14.4) looking at (0.1,1.45,-14.6). Screen x=745 is right of center; screen y=100 is high. A character head at ~3m height and ~4m to the right/front.

