3. Tire bursts: smoke sprite + burst at tirePos, plus remove/flatten the wheel? The truck is created by models.createTruck, wheels are meshes; we could identify the wheel at local (-1.02,0.47,1.82). We can traverse and find wheel meshes by position. Then hide the wheel and add a shredded tire look. Or simply add smoke and a dark burst sprite.
